lines-to-digital-technology","verified":"Fire alarms, burglar alarms and telecare devices that depend on a phone line may need replacement or reconfiguration during digital migration.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"DEPENDENT_DEVICE_MIGRATION_CHECK","direct_score_input":false}]}